    "content" : ", (D9)"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 13,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 54.0, 325.593, 562.097, 354.086 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where Φ0 is the field from the low resolution run, with Φ1,Φ2 getting progressively finer. For second order convergence, we expect C → 4."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 14,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 54.0, 309.392, 562.098, 331.061 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The convergence factor C on the future horizon and at null infinity is plotted in Figure 14 for a representative set of parameters."
